+        "invariant one must traverse the dense graph."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: breadth-first bipartite colouring solves the generated regime "
+        "in O(|V|+|E|); at the initial shipping preset n=96 it is measured by "
+        "selftest on eight seeds, while the compact common-bit route uses at "
+        "most 3n-1=287 exact bit operations."
